INSERT INTO "messages" ("meta","seq","role","session_id","content","reasoning","inserted_at","id") VALUES ($1,$2,$3,$4,$5,$6,$7,$8) [%{}, 70, :assistant, "6080860c-061d-4f12-860f-8ed961e76ae0", "\n\nEverything is verified: dark theme + expanded mobile nav menu render correctly, and the countdown is live (already at 97 from the real interval). All green — `npx vitest run` (9 tests pass), `npx tsc -b --noEmit` clean, `npm run build` clean, and the dev server serves `/` and `/about` on port 4099.\n\nBuilt **Pulse**, a launch-countdown waitlist landing site: `#main-nav` (aria-current active link, `#nav-toggle` mobile menu, `#theme-toggle` light/dark on both widths), hero + `#countdown` ticking from 100 on a real 5s interval, `#signup-form` with validation/dedup feeding `#signups`, a `#stats` strip (`#stat-signups`/`#stat-ticks` from live state), an `#activity` feed (newest-first, capped at 10), a reusable `FeatureGrid` component, and an `/about` page on the shared layout.", "Dark theme works, mobile nav menu expands showing Home (active), Features, About. The countdown already shows 97 (real time ticking). Everything works: mobile + desktop, light + dark, nav toggle, theme toggle, countdown live.\n\nAll requirements verified. Tests pass (9), tsc clean, build clean, dev server on 4099. Done. I'll leave the server running (it's the benchmark artifact's dev server). Reply with one-line summary.\n", ~U[2026-09-11 08:29:38.587784Z], "f8ba7165-bb8e-42d4-847e-a2cf1c4c55f4"]
